  "translation": "I get up at six thirty every morning. I first go to the bathroom to wash my face and brush my teeth. Then I cook breakfast in the kitchen. This morning I made two eggs and a piece of bread. I put the food on the table. I eat while looking at my phone. At this moment the phone rang; it was my mother calling. She asked me what plans I have today. I said I will go to the company to work. She wished me a smooth work day. After eating, I washed the dishes clean, then put on my coat and went out. I walked downstairs and saw a neighbor walking the dog. We greeted each other, then walked together to the subway station. Today the road was very smooth, no traffic jams; I left home and arrived at the company in just thirty minutes."
